            "review_title": "Review at BBQ Ong Map",
            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nGood and reasonably price Korean foods\nSep 2024 • Friends\nWhile searching for a Korean restaurant, I came across Ong Map BBQ .. they have a few outlet, I read the reviews and decided I want to try it … \nThe Staff were friendly and helpful.\nThe menu was quite extensive … many choice to choose ..\nThe Banchan was interesting .. then came the meats that we order plus an egg dish that I ordered was simply delicious. \nOng Map BBQ restaurant is a good option to have both bbq and Korean cooked foods\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
